
Issue5929.agda:42.15-31: warning: -W[no]RewriteVariablesBoundInSingleton
I am not certain that the rewrite rule  circle-elim-loop  is safe
because it appears that the following variable is only bound in
contexts which might become definitionally singular:
  loopᴾ
This warning can be silenced with
  -WnoRewriteVariablesBoundInSingleton
but be aware that this rewrite might behave strangely in the
presence of e.g. eta records with no fields
when checking the pragma REWRITE circle-elim-loop

